      description: 'Read real Pocket Genes Discover publications and events from trusted publishers.',
      breadcrumbHome: 'Pocket Genes',
      eyebrow: 'Discover',
      heading: 'Events and notes from trusted genetics publishers.',
      intro:
        'Browse published Discover items from Pocket Genes: events, news, research updates, opportunities, guides, tools, stories, and community resources.',
